#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai Embodied AI Fund"
msgstr "上海具身智能基金"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:4
msgid "上海具身智能基金"
msgstr "上海具身智能基金"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:6
msgid "Investor | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "投资机构｜浦东新区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:8
msgid ""
"A state-backed embodied-intelligence investment route announced in April "
"2025, including core components and edge chips. Confirm the current "
"manager and investment mandate; no uniform cheque size or ownership "
"percentage is established here."
msgstr "2025年4月公布的国资具身智能投资路径，涉及核心零部件与边缘芯片。须确认现任管理人及投资范围；本书不推定统一投资额或持股比例。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S046 "
"<https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_. "
"上海具身智能基金亮相，上海国投公司加速布局下一代人工智能战略高地_国企动态."
msgstr "`证据 S046 <https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_. 上海具身智能基金亮相，上海国投公司加速布局下一代人工智能战略高地_国企动态."

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:17
msgid "Funding mechanism: Equity investment."
msgstr "支持机制：股权投资。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.gzw.sh.gov.cn/shgzw_zxzx_gqdt/20250422/0df6032bc73b4dbe9d363086336ca821.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:24
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:33
msgid "Confirm the manager, sector, stage and legal-entity fit."
msgstr "确认管理人、行业、阶段及主体匹配。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:35
msgid ""
"Submit a deck, cap table, technology evidence, traction and financing "
"plan."
msgstr "提交路演材料、股权表、技术证据、进展及融资计划。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:37
msgid "Complete commercial, financial, technical and legal due diligence."
msgstr "完成商业、财务、技术及法律尽职调查。"

#: ../../entities/embodied-fund.rst:39
msgid ""
"Review term sheet, investment committee conditions and definitive "
"agreements."
msgstr "审核条款书、投委会条件及正式协议。"

